      <rules>
        <rule name="The Axe Morkai" id="e776-53bd-daad-2053" hidden="false">
          <description>Morkai is a master crafted weapon that Logan can choose to use as either a frost blade or as a power fist. He can choose to split his attacks between the two different weapon types.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Legendary Leader" id="e4ad-5a6a-cb00-5324" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per battle Logan can call on all those nearby to redouble their efforts and attack with all their might. When he does this, all friendly models within 12&quot; of Logan, whether they belong to the Space Wolves or not, get a +1 attack bonus for the rest of the turn. Note that Logan can use this ability during the opponent&apos;s turn if desired.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
